---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Qualiteye"
  description="Privacy policy for qualiteye.com: what data I collect, how I use it and how to contact me."
  canonical="https://qualiteye.com/privacy"
  ogTitle="Privacy Policy — Qualiteye"
  ogUrl="https://qualiteye.com/privacy"
>

<div class="privacy-page">
  <div class="privacy-inner">
    <div class="privacy-eyebrow">Legal</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="privacy-meta">Qualiteye · Last updated: November 2026</p>

    <p class="privacy-lead"><strong>qualiteye.com</strong> is the personal site of Sudarsh M. Sathianathan, based in Bengaluru, India. This policy explains what personal data I collect through this site, how I use it, and your rights.</p>

    <hr />

    <h2>1. Data I collect</h2>
    <p>I collect only the data you choose to send through the contact form: your name, email address, subject and message.</p>
    <p>I don't use tracking cookies, analytics scripts or advertising pixels on this website.</p>

    <h2>2. How I use your data</h2>
    <p>I use it to reply to your message. I don't send marketing email.</p>
    <p>I don't sell, rent or share your personal data with third parties for their own purposes.</p>

    <h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Form submissions on this site are processed by <a href="https://formspree.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Formspree</a>, which stores submissions on my behalf and delivers them to my inbox. Formspree's privacy policy applies to data processed through their service.</p>
    <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may collect basic server access logs (IP address, browser type, request path) as part of standard infrastructure operation.</p>

    <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
    <p>I keep contact form submissions for as long as they're relevant to the conversation. You can request deletion at any time (see section 6).</p>

    <h2>5. Security</h2>
    <p>I take reasonable measures to protect your data from unauthorised access. All data transmitted to and from this site uses HTTPS encryption.</p>

    <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to access, correct or delete personal data I hold about you. To exercise any of these rights, email me at <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> and I'll respond within 30 days.</p>

    <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>I may update this policy as the site changes. The date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.</p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Sudarsh M. Sathianathan<br />
      Bengaluru, India<br />
      <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page { animation: rise 0.7s ease-out both; }
  .privacy-eyebrow { display: none; }
  .privacy-page h1 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
  .privacy-meta { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--faint); margin: 0.25rem 0 1.5rem; }
  .privacy-page hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .privacy-page h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .privacy-page p, .privacy-page li { font-size: 0.97rem; }
  .privacy-page p + p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  .privacy-page ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .privacy-page strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .privacy-page a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-color: var(--line2); }
  .privacy-page a:hover { color: var(--text); }
</style>
